	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Sullins RBB20DHHN: 0.050in [1.27mm] high-density card-edge socket, 20 positions x 2 sides (dual readout), HH = staggered dip-solder tails in 4 rows (3x 0.100in row spacing, 0.100in pitch per row, rows offset 0.050in), N = no mounting ears. Body 1.240x0.370in, card slot 1.050in, accepts 0.062in PCB. Rows top->bottom (component-side view, Figure 1): A1,A3..A19 / A2,A4..A20 / B1,B3..B19 / B2,B4..B20. Card inserted with its top side (pins 1-20) facing row A: pad 1-20 = A20-A1, pad 21-40 = B20-B1 (pad n faces pad n+20). A real PC-1500 card, viewed from its top with the edge up, has pin 1 at the right end. https://datasheet.octopart.com/RBB20DHHN-Sullins-datasheet-138898433.pdf")
	(tags "card edge socket Sullins RBB 1.27mm staggered PC-1500")
